    <string name="ai_intro_alarm_title">ALARM!</string>
    <string name="ai_intro_alarm_body">\"The Glitch\" has breached the World Cloud\'s main server — where every photo, video, and game on earth is stored. The first security wall is down. We need you now.</string>

    <string name="ai_intro_threat_title">The Hacker\'s Plan</string>
    <string name="ai_intro_threat_body">The Glitch disguises malicious viruses as innocent data packets — hiding them in plain sight.\n\nHis goals:\n- Overheat the servers\n- Change every password to \"I-Love-Cookies\"\n- Make the internet impossibly slow worldwide</string>

    <string name="ai_intro_mission_title">Your Mission</string>
    <string name="ai_intro_mission_body">You are our AI Cyber Agent. Guard the data stream — the hacker hides corrupt packets among thousands of good ones.\n\nSpot the one icon that does not belong and tap it fast. The hacker will speed up and get smarter. Do not let a single corrupt packet through!</string>

